    <string name="prefer_ipv4">Prefer IPv4 (only smolnet)</string>
    <string name="about_text">VieY Browser is developed by 呆毛飘啊飘. It is an optimized branch of Vie Browser specifically for smolnet protocols, with unnecessary features removed to keep only the smolnet protocol part. It is a browser that supports multiple languages and various smolnet protocols.\n\nBy the way, if you are a Chinese user, I would recommend using Vie Browser instead, as it offers a higher degree of customization and hundreds of features, supporting over 40 protocols such as sftp, magnet, ftp, etc., and also supports Tampermonkey scripts.</string>
